            "content": {
              "text": "🆕 On September 10, we're kicking off the first-ever GitHub Copilot Day! 🎉 \n\nHear directly from the people building Copilot and the developers putting it to work. Learn the most effective ways to use Copilot, from agents and model choice to working across GitHub, Copilot app, CLI, and @code.\n\nYou can expect technical demos, practical workflows, product announcements, and a few special guests along the way. 👀\n\n🔔 Set your reminder\nhttp://gh.io/GitHubCopilotDay",
