              "text": "If you’re not using a harness with your squad to do loop engineering, are you falling behind?\n\nIf that sentence made you go 🤯, you’ll want to check out the latest GitHub Podcast episode, where we break down the AI lingo developers are hearing right now.\n\nGet it wherever you listen to podcasts or find it here https://the-github-podcast.simplecast.com/episodes/decoding-the-new-ai-lingo-loops-harnesses-squads-and-hill-climbing",
