            "content": {
              "text": "🦞 @openclaw 2.0 has arrived! But what did it take to get here? 👀\n\nFind out how creator @steipete and its maintainers built, scaled, and secured the fastest-growing open source project in GitHub history. 🚀\nhttps://youtu.be/5VSwaUXtPIE?si=vdegRI2eH4wXo2lG",
